        "created_at": "2018-02-17T18:18:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There's not much I can really say right now as there's no way of knowing if there are any inconsistancies with the canon, but I'm curious about what changes will be made once the core rulebook comes out and we actually get all of that information. What I'm saying is it looks good so far.</p><p><span>One suggestion: It sounds like arcs 3 and 4 could be joined into a single collection, since they're both apparently so short and centered around the same plot device: that myserious book.</span></p>",
