        "created_at": "2018-02-20T08:37:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"VGBM\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vgbm/48/2020_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> VGBM:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Say, is it okay for other people to share their campaign ideas here, or should I make my own thread for that?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It would probably be best to make your own thread, that way it is more likely people will see it and know what the thread is about.</p>",
