      {
        "id": 214414,
        "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-02-28T13:43:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wouldn't say *don't* do it, but a space adventure like the one you're describing doesn't really fit the tone of the campaign you're describing.&nbsp; There's a pretty far cry between dealing with a metahuman drug-peddler and running across space, hiding from intergalactic bounty hunters.</p><p>Again, your campaign--do what you like--but tossing in a random space story \"because, comics!\" doesn't sound appealing to me as a player.</p>",
